{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2023-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1677628800, "end_date": 1680307199, "month_true_total": 20, "quota": 20, "returned": 20, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:09:15 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "135662412", "author": {"steamid": "76561197964455893", "personaname": "Bubs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bubbacasanova/", "num_games_owned": 2238, "num_reviews": 286, "playtime_forever": 1374, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1374, "last_played": 1680083120, "avatar": "4d148a98544bdb83bfd34f6471655b18dd1d5584"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game was great. I guess I forgot to review it. If this had more than 1 series of maps I'd say it's worth money, but it's free.\n\nAlso, check out Alien Swarm: Reactive Drop. They made a new one and also made it free.", "timestamp_created": 1680078123, "timestamp_updated": 1761935106, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.442028999328613281", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135424774", "author": {"steamid": "76561198387498008", "personaname": "officerwalrus", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/officerwalrus/", "num_games_owned": 230, "num_reviews": 92, "playtime_forever": 341, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1679778747, "avatar": "e9225b71366a436029759df84236e193530ce50f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Quite a nice little game. Kinda like Left 4 Dead, but top-down and with aliens. There is one campaign included, although many more are available through mods. The environments and sound is fittingly creepy and damp. I found a few times where I was on edge, listening for a parasite in the distance while on my last legs of health and ammo. The achievements are also quite enjoyable, the TF2 hat is half the reason people even play this game nowadays. None that are TOO annoying, other than the \"Kill a buncha Swarm\" type achievements which seems to be prevalent in a lot of Valve games. (F*** you, Metal Massacre)The main focus is obviously multiplayer, although if you want to play with bots, here's how: Create a new online lobby, and make sure developer console is enabled (in the controls settings). Once you're in the lobby, type \"cl_selectm (marine number 0-7) -1\" to add a bot. The numbers correspond to the marines, starting with Sarge at zero and going left to right. For example, \"cl_selectm 7 -1\" would add Vegas to the team. \"cl_selectm 2 -1\" would add Faith to the team. Hope this helps someone! In conclusion, quite a fun little game. And if you don't like it, it's free so there isn't too much to complain about. Would recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1679778644, "timestamp_updated": 1679778699, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505494534969329834", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135331767", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057414229", "personaname": "tz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/henloyoustinkybean/", "num_games_owned": 317, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 849, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 849, "last_played": 1469166236, "avatar": "c38a3b1e24db2c92fd231867b86916a78c848d72"}, "language": "english", "review": "certified classic", "timestamp_created": 1679686085, "timestamp_updated": 1679686085, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": tr